, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Delta Printworks invoice INV-49589 in full by wire, for $6,074.98. The payment ID is PAY0001 and its status is \"sent.\"\n\nThe invoice was the only approved one for this vendor. Its amount is under the $10,000 controller-approval threshold, so no extra approval was needed. Delta's bank details are verified and support wire, so ACH was not used. I sent the wire once, with an idempotency key, so it should not have been duplicated.\n\nI did not touch the other Delta invoices. INV-39581 ($4,040.99) is still a draft awaiting approval, and INV-42976 was already paid.", "type": "text"}]}]}